msgstr "https://wilcosky.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: menagerie.php
msgid "Optional WebP/AVIF upload conversion, JPEG companions, picture/OG fallback, and bulk library conversion for WordPress 7.1+."
msgstr "Conversion facultative des envois en WebP/AVIF, compagnons JPEG, secours picture/OG et conversion en masse de la médiathèque pour WordPress 7.1+."

#. Author of the plugin
#: menagerie.php
msgid "Billy Wilcosky"
msgstr "Billy Wilcosky"

